            "detailed_description": "&quot;Kyoto Colorful Days&quot; is a Visual Novel, set in the sightseeing hotspot of Kyoto.<br />\r\nThis visual novel is populated by various different characters and the story can be enjoyed like a TV drama.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe story centers around the protagonist, a young man who is drifting by aimlessly in life, unable to commit to a job. <br />\r\nWith no particular goal in sight, he visits Kyoto, a city to which his grandfather has connections. <br />\r\nIn his meetings with the local people there, and two girls in particular, he will discover his own path in life.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Romance visual novel<br />\r\n- Opening&amp;Ending song with Japanese vocals<br />\r\n- Fully voiced in Japanese<br />\r\n　Most characters other than the protagonist (the player) will talk in the local Kyoto dialect to really bring the atmosphere of the area to life.<br />\r\n-Including a mode where players can learn greetings and phrases in both standard Japanese and the Kyoto dialect.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n--SNS-------------------<br />\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/DogenzakaLab/<br />\r\nhttps://twitter.com/Dogenzaka_Lab<br />\r\n--HP-------------------<br />\r\nhttp://dogenzaka-lab.com/",
            "about_the_game": "&quot;Kyoto Colorful Days&quot; is a Visual Novel, set in the sightseeing hotspot of Kyoto.<br />\r\nThis visual novel is populated by various different characters and the story can be enjoyed like a TV drama.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe story centers around the protagonist, a young man who is drifting by aimlessly in life, unable to commit to a job. <br />\r\nWith no particular goal in sight, he visits Kyoto, a city to which his grandfather has connections. <br />\r\nIn his meetings with the local people there, and two girls in particular, he will discover his own path in life.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Romance visual novel<br />\r\n- Opening&amp;Ending song with Japanese vocals<br />\r\n- Fully voiced in Japanese<br />\r\n　Most characters other than the protagonist (the player) will talk in the local Kyoto dialect to really bring the atmosphere of the area to life.<br />\r\n-Including a mode where players can learn greetings and phrases in both standard Japanese and the Kyoto dialect.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n--SNS-------------------<br />\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/DogenzakaLab/<br />\r\nhttps://twitter.com/Dogenzaka_Lab<br />\r\n--HP-------------------<br />\r\nhttp://dogenzaka-lab.com/",
            "short_description": "&quot;Kyoto Colorful Days&quot; is a Visual Novel, set in the sightseeing hotspot of Kyoto.This visual novel is populated by various different characters and the story can be enjoyed like a TV drama.　Fully voiced in Japanese (the Kyoto dialect)",
